          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe combine deep technical expertise with a genuine understanding of your business goals. Our agile approach means faster delivery, fewer surprises, and a product you\u0027re proud to launch.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDedicated cross-functional teams\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETransparent project management\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPost-launch support included\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"
